# Code Quality

**Minimal Changes Principle**:

- Only modify code related to the specific task
- Avoid unnecessary refactoring or cleanup
- Preserve existing comments and documentation
- Maintain backward compatibility

**Testing Considerations**:

- Test across all supported p5.js variants manually using the sketches in the examples directory
- Include visual regression testing for creative functions
- Test performance with large datasets
- Verify cross-browser compatibility

**Code Review Focus**:

- Performance impact on real-time rendering
- Cross-variant compatibility
- Mathematical accuracy
- Visual output quality
- Error handling robustness
